          "name": "Service",
          "rating": 9.2,
          "description": "Staff repeatedly praised as professional, friendly and helpful (reception, check-in assistance, concierge-type help). However there are notable service failures: long check-in process in some cases and a problematic check-in incident where a partner was not allowed to check in despite prior notice."
        },
        {
          "name": "Location",
          "rating": 9.3,
          "description": "Consistently highlighted as an excellent, central location — well connected by metro/bus and close to attractions. Drawback: lively street and late-night tourist/club noise reported by several guests."
        },
        {
          "name": "Room Quality",
          "rating": 8.6,
          "description": "Rooms described as spacious, comfortable with good showers and balconies. Some negatives: mattress sometimes too soft for some guests and internal doors are not very soundproof leading to hallway noise."
        },
        {
          "name": "Amenities",
          "rating": 9,
          "description": "Strong amenities noted: complimentary mini-bar, work cabins, comfortable common areas. Minor complaints: in-room coffee machine awkward to use, and some expected 4-star items (slippers) not provided by default; toiletries sometimes had to be requested."
        },
        {
          "name": "Value for Money",
          "rating": 8.2,
          "description": "Mixed: several guests felt the experience justified the price (upgrades, early check-in options), while others felt the high price did not match problems like late/chaotic check-in or missing expected toiletries."
        },
        {
          "name": "Food and Beverage",
          "rating": 9.6,
          "description": "Very strong positive sentiment for breakfast and dining: multiple guests called the breakfast excellent/very rich and praised available meals; generally high satisfaction with food offerings."
        },
        {
          "name": "Overall Experience",
          "rating": 8.8,
          "description": "Overall positive experience for most guests (many would return, several 'everything was great' reports), tempered by recurring issues around check-in logistics and street/night noise."
        }
      ]
    },
